OL,3,GNEWSADecision on 2,400-acre solar farm
OL,4,Apostponed again
OL,5,
OL,6,FControversial plans to build one of the
OL,7,FUK's largest solar farms have been
OL,8,Fdelayed further by the government,
OL,9,Fwhich says it needs additional time to
OL,10,F"consider further information".
OL,12,FDeveloper Photovolt Development
OL,13,FPartners (PVDP) wants to build the
OL,14,FBotley West Solar Farm across more than
OL,15,F2,000 acres of land to the north and
OL,16,Fwest of Oxford.
OL,18,FA decision on the scheme had been due
OL,19,Fearlier this year, before being pushed
OL,20,Fback to September 2026 by then-Energy
OL,21,FSecretary Ed Miliband.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
