OL,3,GNEWSADecision on 2,400-acre solar farm
OL,4,Apostponed again
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement on Wednesday, the
OL,7,Fgovernment confirmed that its decision
OL,8,Fon the proposals would now be further
OL,9,Fpostponed until 10 November at the
OL,10,Flatest.
